1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,151
Zinc is the metal that protects other metals.

2
00:00:03,151 --> 00:00:08,750
The Ganesh Himal lead zinc deposit in Dhading is Nepal's best known metal prospect.

3
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:12,122
The chief ore is zinc blende, zinc sulphide.

4
00:00:12,122 --> 00:00:15,664
Others are calamine, zincite and willemite.

